      "location": "Refutation 2.1",
      "defect": "unlicensed-inference",
      "evidence": "The step concludes “hence b^3=1 ... So G contains a nontrivial torsion element.” The equation b^3=1 alone permits b=1 and does not establish nontriviality. One must additionally identify the presentation with C3 or give a quotient onto C3.",
