      "defect": "unlicensed-inference",
      "evidence": "After setting M=N1∩⋯∩Nm, the proof says “the element g1 can be adjusted inside its M-coset so that its image in each quotient ... equals the prescribed coordinate.” Since M⊆Nk, every element of g1M has the same image g1Nk, so such adjustment cannot change any prescribed coordinate. A valid proof must use a representative of the compatible M-coordinate of a nonempty cylinder.",
